  "title": "MD Anderson’s Institute for Data Science in Oncology establishes internal advisory council to maximize impact | UT MD Anderson",
  "description": "The Institute for Data Science in Oncology (IDSO) at The University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center today announced the establishment of its internal advisory council to identify needs and opportunities for data science development and integration across MD Anderson, advancing work that will yield significant benefits for patients and families.",
